{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"七年春，衛侯使孫良夫來盟。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"夏，公會齊侯伐萊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"秋，公至自伐萊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"大旱。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"冬，公會晉侯、宋公、衛侯、鄭伯、曹伯于黑壤。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"七年春，衛孫桓子來盟，始通，且謀會晉也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"夏，公會齊侯伐萊，不與謀也。凡師出，與謀曰「及」，不與謀曰「會」。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"赤狄侵晉，取向陰之禾。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"鄭及晉平，公子宋之謀也，故相鄭伯以會。冬，盟于黑壤，王叔桓公臨之，以謀不睦。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_121_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_121","textTraditional":"晉侯之立也，公不朝焉，又不使大夫聘，晉人止公于會。盟于黃父，公不與盟，以賂免。故黑壤之盟不書，諱之也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}